 "description": {
  "en": "Bag insert QR (W-QR): the owner prints an A6 card / 8 stickers for delivery bags whose QR (drawn by the Worker with the table codes' encoder, qrcodegen MIT) opens exactly https://<venue-host>/?src=bag[&c=<campaign>]. The storefront keeps the landing in sessionStorage only (key dw_src) and sends it once, as the order body's `src` member, at checkout; the order records `referral`. The owner's ONE public welcome offer (fixed amount off a minimum basket, a named dish on the house, or a double stamp) is applied inside the venue object's placement turn, once per phone (the stamp card's alias circle): a second use places the order at full price with `welcome_refused: used`. Menu prices never change; the bonus is a discount recorded on the order. The owner card counts bag orders, guests, repeat orders, and a commission-saved estimate only from a percent the owner typed. Scans are NOT counted (nothing is written before an order).",
  "uk": "QR-картка в пакети доставки: відкриває сайт закладу з ?src=bag; вітальна пропозиція один раз на номер телефону, ціни меню не змінюються; атрибуція лише першої сторони (sessionStorage до оформлення)."
 },
