 "probe": "tools/live-proof/probes/feature-bag-qr.mjs: reads the owner card (schema), sets a 1-lek fixed offer, reads the public offer (schema, no Set-Cookie), checks the QR svg route and that card.url's host is the venue's own host, places a TEST order with src=bag from a fresh phone (welcome granted, referral recorded, line prices untouched) and a second one from the same phone (welcome_refused=used, full price), checks stats.orders rose by 2; then rejects both and restores the owner's original offer.",
